{
  "name": "BMS AI Agent - Direct API (Simplified)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "public": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "chat-trigger",
      "name": "When chat message received",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [240, 300],
      "webhookId": "bms-ai-direct"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "query-field",
              "name": "query",
              "value": "={{ $json?.chatInput || $json.body?.chatInput || $json.query }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "session-field",
              "name": "sessionId",
              "value": "={{ $json?.sessionId || $json.body?.sessionId || 'default-session' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "parse-input",
      "name": "Parse Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [460, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:8000/api/v1/ask",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ query: $json.query, max_chunks: 5, include_citations: true }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "autodetect"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "call-bms-api",
      "name": "Call BMS API",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "format-response",
              "name": "response",
              "value": "={{ $json.answer || 'No answer found' }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "add-citations",
              "name": "citations",
              "value": "={{ $json.citations || [] }}",
              "type": "array"
            },
            {
              "id": "add-confidence",
              "name": "confidence",
              "value": "={{ $json.confidence || 0 }}",
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-output",
      "name": "Format Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [900, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-to-webhook",
      "name": "Respond to Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1120, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## BMS AI Agent - Direct API (Simplified)\n\n**WHY THIS APPROACH:**\nThe legacy toolHttpRequest node in n8n 1.113.3 has compatibility issues with $fromAI() expressions.\nThis simplified workflow directly calls the BMS API /api/v1/ask endpoint without AI Agent complexity.\n\n**ARCHITECTURE:**\n1. Chat Trigger receives user question\n2. Parse Input extracts query and sessionId\n3. Call BMS API directly with the question\n4. Format Output structures the response\n5. Respond to Webhook sends back to user\n\n**ADVANTAGES:**\n- No AI Agent tool initialization errors\n- Direct, reliable API calls\n- Simpler to debug and maintain\n- Works with n8n 1.113.3\n\n**USAGE:**\nChat interface at: /webhook-test/bms-ai-direct\n\n**FOR MS TEAMS INTEGRATION:**\nThis webhook can be called from the MS Teams Bot Main Handler workflow",
        "height": 520,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [180, 60]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When chat message received": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Parse Input",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Parse Input": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Call BMS API",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Call BMS API": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Format Output",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Format Output": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Respond to Webhook",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "staticData": null,
